    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/b002d5cf300d9e747d70354c50fa1ca7.poster.avif?t=1739033203\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/b002d5cf300d9e747d70354c50fa1ca7.webm?t=1739033203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/b002d5cf300d9e747d70354c50fa1ca7.mp4?t=1739033203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/cf4ad2e37d418cca355b089dc189f598.avif?t=1739033203\" width=584 height=123 /></span><br>Heald, the prince of Centralis went missing. Axyn was sent to Arkaika to look for him. There, he stumbled upon the ruins of a mysterious ancient temple. Will Axyn discover the secrets of the ancient civilization and will he find the prince?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/6d7221366ecab423cf289a1df5f329d2.avif?t=1739033203\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/2aaa9a786c2d8c03f5c16d6deb50adfc.avif?t=1739033203\" width=584 height=123 /></span><br>Axyn Adventure is a retro style 3D platformer. You take control of the titular character Axyn and embarks on many adventures with your friends Yunn and Leaf. Play in the vast open levels using you big set of moves to get around. Collect as many items as you can to advance the story and unlock tons of content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/ee4e9e97f79a12b161a1ff806320cb7d.avif?t=1739033203\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/69300965ab21aaa7883b99d0608e8a00.avif?t=1739033203\" width=584 height=123 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A retro style collectathon.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of movement abilities to master.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute femboys and twinks (very gay).</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully animated 3D sex scenes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hot voice acting.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cool retro style music.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of outfits and accessories to unlock.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or you can play with Axyn being naked. ;)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372620/extras/ff6205937168b0c5fa1187a2cd93d58b.avif?t=1739033203\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
